B2Makeup "B2 makeup" 0 480 240 lin -24 24 dB 1 | Band 2: gain after the dynamics (negative cuts the band)
    how Adds or removes up to 24 dB of gain on band 2 after the dynamics.
    sound Positive values lift the band; negative values cut it, changing the tonal balance.
B2Solo "B2 solo" 0 1 0 switch | Band 2: hear only the soloed bands (processed, Mix ignored)
    how Plays only the soloed bands, processed, ignoring Mix.
    sound You hear band 2 by itself, which helps you set its dynamics.
B2Bypass "B2 bypass" 0 1 0 switch | Band 2: pass the band untouched (no dynamics, no makeup)
    how Passes band 2 untouched, with no dynamics and no makeup.
    sound Band 2 sounds as it came in, so you can compare with and without it.
